# Applies on top of, in order:
#   tools/patches/sortnetopt-macos-proc.patch
#   tools/patches/sortnetopt-instrumentation-v3.patch
# against the pinned upstream commit 0b5d09c47446096f9e3a0812b35afc72b7f2a718.
# Apply with:  patch -V none -p1 -i <this file>
#
# The Isabelle/HOL-extracted checker (checker/) is not touched. The certificate
# pipeline (prune / prune-all / gen-proof) is not touched.
#
# Controlled entirely by environment variables; with none set the search is
# behaviourally identical to the instrumentation baseline (no index is
